From b49b92a4bf98cd5a7ffd8c4243445da1205ac698 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Code Review <review@local>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 05:35:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: per-user chat data isolation + live-test UI fixes

- Fix critical cross-user data leak: thread user_id through QAAgent,
  GraphAgent, ReportAgent; scope get_all_invoices_matrix, semantic
  search, and report state via explicit arg or request context var;
  strict in-memory user filtering in get_all_invoices
- Hide internal system messages from the chat UI
- Fix password inputs rendering dark: color-scheme light, autofill
  paper theme, text placeholders, clear on auth view switch
- Toast stamps: plain DONE/NOTICE/ALERT instead of [FILED] etc.
- Currency-aware AMOUNT column headers and KPI currency label
- Charts: drop empty figures, paper-ink palette instead of Plotly blues
- Gate app shell behind login; remove ChromaDB jargon from delete dialog
---
